  "notes": "{減|へ}らす means to reduce, decrease, or cut down on something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{減|へ}る→減る：01985_heru⟧ (intransitive) - something decreases on its own\n- Pattern: [something]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす\n\nOPPOSITE PAIR:\n- {減|へ}らす ↔ ⟦{増|ふ}やす→増やす：02410_fuyasu⟧ (to increase - transitive)\n- ⟦{減|へ}る→減る：01985_heru⟧ ↔ ⟦{増|ふ}える→増える：01183_fueru⟧ (to increase - intransitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{体重|たいじゅう}→体重：03395_taijuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす: to lose weight\n- ⟦{無駄|むだ}→無駄：02512_muda⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす: to reduce waste\n- ⟦{費用|ひよう}→費用：03588_hiyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす: to cut costs\n- ⟦{時間|じかん}→時間：00468_jikan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす: to reduce time\n- ⟦ストレス→ストレス：03827_sutoresu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす: to reduce stress\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n⟦{腹|はら}→腹：02165_hara⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす literally 'to reduce one's stomach' means 'to get hungry.'",
